### ====================================================================
### Neatio Showcase — The Fika & Kudos Ledger API
### Chronological Request Walkthrough (IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### Base URL: http://localhost:9080
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9080
@correlationId = c83b4b8c-572f-4882-93cb-3392305a415b

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### STEP 1: Verify MicroProfile Health Liveness & Readiness
### Expected: 200 OK with UP status
### --------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json


### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### STEP 2: Inspect Initial Balances
### Expected: 
###   - Linnea (SE-9821): balance = 4 credits
###   - Erik (SE-1001): balance = 50 credits
### --------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ledger/SE-9821
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ledger/SE-1001
Accept: application/json


### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### STEP 3: Attempt Fika Voucher Redemption with Insufficient Balance
### Scenario: Linnea (SE-9821) has only 4 credits, but 10 are required.
### Expected: HTTP 422 Unprocessable Entity (RFC 7807 Problem Details)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fika/redeem
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: {{correlationId}}

{
  "employeeId": "SE-9821"
}


### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### STEP 4: Trigger Bean Validation Errors
### Scenario: Invalid amount (0) and missing/blank sender ID.
### Expected: HTTP 400 Bad Request (RFC 7807 with invalidParameters)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kudos
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: {{correlationId}}

{
  "senderId": "",
  "recipientId": "SE-9821",
  "amount": 0,
  "message": "Hi",
  "category": "TEAMWORK"
}


### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### STEP 5: Trigger Business Rule Violation (Self-Transfer)
### Scenario: Employee attempts to transfer Kudos to themselves.
### Expected: HTTP 422 Unprocessable Entity (RFC 7807 Problem Details)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kudos
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: {{correlationId}}

{
  "senderId": "SE-1001",
  "recipientId": "SE-1001",
  "amount": 5,
  "message": "Sending kudos to myself",
  "category": "KINDNESS"
}


### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### STEP 6: Execute Valid Kudos Transfer
### Scenario: Erik (SE-1001) sends 20 credits to Linnea (SE-9821).
### Expected: HTTP 201 Created with transaction receipt
### --------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kudos
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: {{correlationId}}

{
  "senderId": "SE-1001",
  "recipientId": "SE-9821",
  "amount": 20,
  "message": "Outstanding work architecting the Neatio Framework showcase!",
  "category": "CRAFTSMANSHIP"
}


### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### STEP 7: Verify Updated Balances Post-Transfer
### Expected:
###   - Linnea (SE-9821): balance = 24 credits (4 + 20)
###   - Erik (SE-1001): balance = 30 credits (50 - 20)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ledger/SE-9821
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ledger/SE-1001
Accept: application/json


### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### STEP 8: Linnea Redeems First Fika Voucher (Cost: 10 Credits)
### Expected: HTTP 200 OK with QR Voucher payload and expiry
### --------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fika/redeem
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: {{correlationId}}

{
  "employeeId": "SE-9821"
}


### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### STEP 9: Linnea Redeems Second Fika Voucher (Cost: 10 Credits)
### Expected: HTTP 200 OK with second QR Voucher
### --------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fika/redeem
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: {{correlationId}}

{
  "employeeId": "SE-9821"
}


### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### STEP 10: Verify Final Ledger State and Audit Trail
### Expected:
###   - Linnea balance = 4 credits
###   - Vouchers redeemed = 2
###   - Recent transactions list contains transfer and redemptions
### --------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ledger/SE-9821
Accept: application/json


### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### STEP 11: Inspect MicroProfile Metrics & OpenAPI Documentation
### --------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi
Accept: application/json
